---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Accessibility | Lead Strategy" description="Lead Strategy accessibility commitment and feedback channel.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Accessibility" title="Access is part of the build." lead="We are working toward WCAG 2.2 AA and will publish known limitations instead of hiding them." />
	<section class="section shell"><div class="legal-copy"><h2>Our approach</h2><p>The site is designed for keyboard navigation, visible focus, semantic headings, reduced motion preferences, responsive zoom and useful alternative text.</p><h2>Ongoing checks</h2><p>Automated testing will be combined with keyboard, screen-reader and device testing. New content and commerce flows will be checked before publication.</p><h2>Feedback</h2><p>If anything prevents you from using this site, email <a href="mailto:hello@leadstrategy.ca">hello@leadstrategy.ca</a>. Include the page, the task you were trying to complete and your preferred response format if useful.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
